# Pessoas
### List all users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/
?limit=10
&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
### List one user
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/14/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
### Create a user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "luiz@email.com",
    "password": "123456",
    "nome": "Luiz"
}
### Update a user
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/23/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "aaaaaa"
}
### Delete a user
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/16/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}



